class=3D"o">&gt;=3D</span> <span class=3D"mi">1024</span><span class=3D"p">=
,</span> <span class=3D"s">'Minimum port must be at least 1024.'</span>
    <span class=3D"c1"># The following code depends on the previous assert.
</span>    <span class=3D"n">port</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span=
