<p><a id=3D"s2.12-default-argument-values"></a>
<a id=3D"212-default-argument-values"></a></p>

<p><a id=3D"default-arguments"></a></p>
<h3 id=3D"212-default-argument-values">2.12 Default Argument Values<a class=
=3D"anchorjs-link " href=3D"https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.htm=
l#212-default-argument-values" aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=
=EE=A7=8B" style=3D"font: 1em / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"><=
