"s">'{}, {}'</span><span class=3D"p">.</span><span class=3D"nb">format</spa=
n><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">first</span><span class=3D"p"=
>,</span> <span class=3D"n">second</span><span class=3D"p">)</span>
     <span class=3D"n">x</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span class=3D=
"s">'name: %s; score: %d'</span> <span class=3D"o">%</span> <span class=3D"=
p">(</span><span class=3D"n">name</span><span class=3D"p">,</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"n">n</span><span class=3D"p">)</span>
     <span class=3D"n">x</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span class=3D=
"s">'name: %(name)s; score: %(score)d'</span> <span class=3D"o">%</span> <s=
pan class=3D"p">{</span><span class=3D"s">'name'</span><span class=3D"p">:<=
/span><span class=3D"n">name</span><span class=3D"p">,</span> <span class=
