<p><code class=3D"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">pylint</code>
allows you to move the closing parenthesis to a new line and align with the
opening one, but this is less readable.</p>

<div class=3D"language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class=3D"highlight"><=
pre class=3D"highlight"><code><span class=3D"n">No</span><span class=3D"p">=
:</span>
