LongType</span><span class=3D"p">,</span> <span class=3D"n">MyLongType</spa=
n><span class=3D"p">]:</span>
  <span class=3D"p">...</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>As in the examples above, prefer not to break types. However, sometimes =
they are
too long to be on a single line (try to keep sub-types unbroken).</p>

