<p><a id=3D"type-aliases"></a></p>
<h4 id=3D"3196-type-aliases">3.19.6 Type Aliases<a class=3D"anchorjs-link "=
 href=3D"https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html#3196-type-aliases=
" aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" style=3D"font: 1em=
 / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h4>

<p>You can declare aliases of complex types. The name of an alias should be
